WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.594 --> 00:00:02.962
THIS IS THE WAKE-UP CALL FOR ALL

00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:04.764
OF US.

00:00:04.765 --> 00:00:06.732
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AMEN.

00:00:06.733 --> 00:00:08.234
BEFORE WE GO TONIGHT, WE WANT TO

00:00:08.235 --> 00:00:10.136
PASS ON OUR CONGRATULATIONS TO

00:00:10.137 --> 00:00:11.203
SOMEONE WE LOVE.

00:00:11.204 --> 00:00:14.206
THE SIX MARATHON MAJORS.

00:00:14.207 --> 00:00:16.375
HE USED TO RUN ALL SIX OF THEM.

00:00:16.376 --> 00:00:17.109
HE JUST COMPLETED HIS THIRD IN

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.311
LONDON OVER THE WEEKEND.

00:00:19.312 --> 00:00:20.746
HE HAS ALREADY RAISED IN

00:00:20.747 --> 00:00:21.414
NEW YORK AND BERLIN.

00:00:21.415 --> 00:00:22.314
HE WAS HOPING TO BEAT HIS

00:00:22.315 --> 00:00:26.519
PREVIOUS TIMES, AND HE DID.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:26.952
BY 6 MINUTES.

00:00:26.953 --> 00:00:29.655
HE FINISHED THE RACE IN THREE

00:00:29.656 --> 00:00:31.590
HOURS AND 23 SECONDS.

00:00:31.591 --> 00:00:33.092
UNBELIEVABLY FAST.

00:00:33.093 --> 00:00:36.663
IF YOU THINK ABOUT IT.

